<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-UHIS TO ISSUE MORE BONDS IN SEPTEMBER.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-UHIS TO ISSUE MORE BONDS IN SEPTEMBER.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uhispank said on Friday it plans to make the second issue from its bond programme listed on the Luxembourg bourse in Septmeber.</p>
<p>The amount of the second issue depends on the market, the bank's vice president Ulo Suurkask told a news conference.</p>
<p>Uhispank in June issued 360 million kroons in bonds on the Luxembourg bourse, the first issue of an 800 million kroons programme.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
